1
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,750
My lord, you’re here.

2
00:00:08,791 --> 00:00:10,458
What are you doing here?

3
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:12,625
Someone disrespected Lord Redmond.

4
00:00:12,625 --> 00:00:15,166
I came to handle it,
but they’re stronger than expected.

5
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:16,916
We need your
elite forces, my lord.

6
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:17,541
-Who?

7
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:21,041
That bench over there, and those two miners! 

8
00:00:31,083 --> 00:00:32,791
Lady Cassia.

9
00:00:32,791 --> 00:00:34,958
He belongs to you?

10
00:00:36,041 --> 00:00:37,791
Did he offend you, my lady?

11
00:00:37,791 --> 00:00:39,791
Offending me is minor.

12
00:00:40,291 --> 00:00:42,500
But he threatened
to kill Lord Severin.

13
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,625
That is a very big problem.

14
00:00:44,625 --> 00:00:45,833
What?!

15
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:49,458
I’m here.

16
00:00:49,458 --> 00:00:51,458
Lord Severin, forgive me!

17
00:00:52,291 --> 00:00:55,000
This is my failure
to control my subordinates.

18
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:58,000
I’ll deal with him immediately.

19
00:00:58,583 --> 00:00:59,958
My lord, what are you doing?

20
00:01:00,833 --> 00:01:03,958
He's just a disowned bastard. Don't fall for his act!

21
00:01:03,958 --> 00:01:05,750
Shut your mouth.

22
00:01:12,041 --> 00:01:13,500
My lord, no!

23
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,708
Please!

24
00:01:17,791 --> 00:01:20,000
It’s handled, my lord.

25
00:01:20,291 --> 00:01:21,625
Please forgive me.

26
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:25,250
You know the punishment
for offending Lord Severin.

27
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:26,500
I know.

28
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,375
I’ll sever my own
right arm right here!

29
00:01:28,375 --> 00:01:30,250
You came for my wedding today?

30
00:01:30,250 --> 00:01:32,250
Y-yes, my lord.

31
00:01:32,666 --> 00:01:34,791
Since you came to congratulate
me, 

32
00:01:34,791 --> 00:01:36,666
I’ll spare you this once.

33
00:01:37,208 --> 00:01:39,416
Thank you, my lord!

34
00:01:40,291 --> 00:01:41,791
Bring the gifts!

35
00:01:42,291 --> 00:01:46,166
From Black Raven City: A
legendary Dragon Egg worth ten million!

36
00:01:46,166 --> 00:01:48,541
Three ancient magic codexes!

37
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,208
A Golden Dragon stallion!

38
00:01:51,791 --> 00:01:55,208
And twenty million raw gold coins!

39
00:01:55,208 --> 00:01:56,833
Take it back.

40
00:01:56,833 --> 00:01:59,083
The Scott family canceled the wedding.

41
00:02:00,291 --> 00:02:01,250
What?

42
00:02:01,250 --> 00:02:01,916
Canceled?

43
00:02:01,916 --> 00:02:04,125
The noble Lady Livia
declared that a lowly

44
00:02:04,125 --> 00:02:06,125
miner like me
is unworthy of her.

45
00:02:06,125 --> 00:02:08,250
She is marrying Redmond instead.

46
00:02:09,541 --> 00:02:11,000
She wants to marry who?

47
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,291
Who is Redmond?

48
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:18,750
Lord Darren, Severin is
just a disowned bastard.

49
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:20,166
Why do you
respect him so much?

50
00:02:20,166 --> 00:02:24,791
You’re telling me Lord Severin
is a disowned son of yours?
